      en: ["{a.first} calls you, furious: your 5-year-old grandson called his teacher a 'bangs-wearing old bat-hag' at school. He says you say it while watching the news.", "Daycare summoned {a.first}: your granddaughter yelled 'GODDAMN SHIT-BUCKET' when she spilled her applesauce. '{Grandpa|Grandma} says that,' she explained."],
