      en: ["The phone rings. A congested voice: '{Grandpa|Grandma}, it's me, your grandson! I had an accident in Spain, I'm in jail, I need {$amount} in gift cards. Don't tell dad.'", "'Hello, this is Microsoft tech support. Your computer is infected. To fix it, install this software and read me your card number.' The man has a thick accent and a rooster crowing behind him."],
